{
  "name": "@red-cup-engineering/market-561-group",
  "version": "0.2.1",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "market.561.group: the one x402 market of the 561 Group. Composes the market engine over data/records/catalog.json, where every offer names the typed operation it sells by package and export; carries no compute, no per-offer transport, and no domain of its own beyond the market's. Adding an offer is a catalog entry and a dependency pin.",
